摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Template for deepseek-harness plugin development.","id":"gh:1333375150","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-plugin-template","slug":"bugmaker2/dsh-plugin-template","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Template for deepseek-harness plugin development."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-template"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A complete dual-side DeepSeek Harness plugin template. It demonstrates the full plugin surface — a *"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"*host** plugin exposing a Typert Remote, and a **client** plugin mounting that Remote into a React v"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"iew — with type-checking, linting, unit tests, CI, and publishing metadata wired up."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Out of the box it registers a `greet` Remote: the host composes `\"Hello, <name>\"` from a configurabl"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"e prefix, and the client renders the result in a new \"Greet\" tab."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Structure"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"`package.json` is the only manifest Harness needs. `dsh.bundle.patch` makes the package an installab"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"le profile bundle; `dsh.client` declares the Web client bundle and the client packages it injects. T"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"he host entry is the ordinary Cordis `name`/`apply` export; the client entry is bundled to `lib/clie"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"nt.js` and loaded by the Web harness module loader."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- Node.js `>= 22.19` (or `>= 24`)\n- pnpm `>= 9`\n- DeepSeek Harness `>=0.1.0-rc.6`"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Install from a local checkout"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Restart the Web Harness after rebuilding the plugin. A \"Greet\" tab appears in the session view ring "},{"id":"p13s2","text":"showing `Hello, DSH`."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Remove it with:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Install from Git"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"A Git install fetches sources, not built artifacts, so pnpm runs the `prepare` script to build `lib/"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"`. pnpm ≥10 blocks that build until you allow it; on the first failed `add`, `dsh` prints the fix — "},{"id":"p18s3","text":"copy the package key it shows into the profile's `pnpm-workspace.yaml`:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"then re-run the `add`. That allowance lets the package run code at install time, so only allow packa"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"ges you trust (and pin a commit)."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"`check` runs `typecheck`, `lint`, `test`, and `build`. CI runs the same command after `pnpm install "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"heck`, `lint`, `test`, and `build`. CI runs the same command after `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Individual scripts:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Renaming the package"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Keep these values in sync when you rename:"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"- `package.json` → `name`, `exports`, `files`\n- `build.mjs` → the `__ModuleLoader__.load` id\n- `src/"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"index.ts` → `name`\n- `src/client/remote.ts` → package id and the `TypertRemoteNamespace$…` hex of th"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"e service key\n- `src/client/locales.ts` → locale namespace key\n- `src/client/index.tsx` → slot id\n- "},{"id":"p28s4","text":"`src/typert.ts` → `package`\n- `src/contract.ts` → invocation ids\n- `cordis.patch.yml` → `id` and `na"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"me`\n- `dsh.plugin.json` → `id`"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"## Discoverability"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Add the GitHub topic `dsh-plugin` to your fork:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":